     "text": "**Jansen (2025).** Took link ratios from a reference paper. Drew the linkage in AutoCAD with fixed lengths and fixed points so each joint acted as a pivot, scaled it up, then moved the pivot-to-pivot lengths into SolidWorks. Added a real Arduino Uno, 997 DC motor and TalentCell battery, and animated the gait."
